    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Experiences",
     "texto": [
      "**hayatımda** = in my life; **ilk kez** = for the first time; **unutulmaz** = unforgettable.",
      "**-di** describes a completed event: **ilk kez uçakla seyahat ettim** = I travelled by plane for the first time.",
      "Link a reason with **çünkü** («because») or a consequence with **bu nedenle** («for this reason»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
